ead, update, delete, search, and count operations",[282,290,291,294,295,299],{},[285,292,293],{},"Full-text search"," - Mark fields with ",[296,297,298],"code",{},"@Text"," to enable full-text search out of the box",[282,301,302,305],{},[285,303,304],{},"Schema evolution"," - Use versioned migration scripts to evolve your data schema safely over time",[282,307,308,311],{},[285,309,310],{},"Multi-tenancy"," - Built-in tenant isolation at the data layer with shared index support",[282,313,314,317],{},[285,315,316],{},"Named queries"," - Define custom query methods with a SQL-like syntax",[274,319,321],{"id":320},"workflow","Workflow",[270,323,324],{},"The typical workflow for working with Kinotic persistence is:",[326,327,328,337,347],"ol",{},[282,329,330,333,334],{},[285,331,332],{},"Define your entity"," - Create a TypeScript class with decorators from ",[296,335,336],{},"@kinotic-ai\u002Fpersistence",[282,338,339,342,343,346],{},[285,340,341],{},"Sync to server"," - Run ",[296,344,345],{},"kinotic sync"," to push your entity definitions to the Kinotic server and generate typed service classes",[282,348,349,352],{},[285,350,351],{},"Use in your app"," - Import and use the generated services to perform data operations",[274,354,356],{"id":355},"packages","Packages",[270,358,359],{},"Two packages work together to provide the persistence layer:",[279,361,362,382],{},[282,363,364,368,369,372,373,372,376,372,379,381],{},[285,365,366],{},[296,367,336],{}," - Provides entity decorators (",[296,370,371],{},"@Entity",", ",[296,374,375],{},"@AutoGeneratedId",[296,377,378],{},"@NotNull",[296,380,298],{},", etc.), entity service interfaces, and the persistence plugin",[282,383,384,389,390,393],{},[285,385,386],{},[296,387,388],{},"@kinotic-ai\u002Fcore"," - Provides the connection layer (",[296,391,392],{},"Kinotic.connect()","), pagination types, and core utilities shared across all Kinotic packages",{"title":395,"searchDepth":396,"depth":396,"links":397},"",2,[398,399,400],{"id":276,"depth":396,"text":277},{"id":320,"depth":396,"text":321},{"id":355,"depth":396,"text":356},"Kinotic's persistence layer provides declarative data management with automatic CRUD service generation from TypeScript entity definitions.","md",null,{},true,{"title":31,"description":401},"g8NUkMC0tuV7NialQA4y8KUJpDwirmLhankBQvKHAX8",[409,411],{"title":85,"path":86,"stem":87,"description":410,"children":-1},"Real-time data streaming between services and clients.",{"title":98,"path":99,"stem":100,"description":412,"children":-1},"How to define entities using TypeScript decorators for Kinotic's persistence layer.",1792934226772]